{#
 luci-app-mt3600be-toggle —— ucode 模板（GL 原厂风格）

 布局：
   1. 保存栏置顶（有改动才可点「保存」）
   2. 开关演示 —— 纯状态展示，不可点击、不做模拟
   3. 拨动开关功能 —— 左栏「功能选项」/ 右栏「可控制」
   4. RESET 重置键 —— 每个手势都可选「禁用」

 重要：本模板只输出版式，**不要**在这里内联 <script>。
 ucode 模板引擎会把内联 JS 里的 ${...}、反引号和引号当作自身语法解析，
 报 "Unable to compile source file ... Syntax error: Unexpected token"。
 交互逻辑在 www/luci-static/resources/mt3600be-toggle/toggle.js，
 后端地址通过下面 #gl 上的 data-* 属性传入。
-#}

{% include('header') %}

<style>
    #gl { --bg:#f2f3f5; --card:#ffffff; --line:#ebedf0; --text:#26313e; --muted:#8a94a6;
          --accent:#5b6efa; --apply:#6a7bfa; --teal:#16b8a8; --warn:#f59e0b; --ok:#22a45d;
          font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei",Roboto,sans-serif;
          background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); padding:20px 24px; line-height:1.5;
          -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
    #gl * { box-sizing:border-box; }
    #gl button { font-family:inherit; }
    #gl button, #gl input, #gl select, #gl textarea { border:0 !important; outline:0; }
    #gl input[type=text] { border:1px solid var(--line) !important; border-radius:10px !important; }

    #gl .wrap { max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; }

    #gl .pghead { margin-bottom:16px; }
    #gl .pgtitle { font-size:20px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.3px; }
    #gl .pgsub { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:3px; }

    #gl .card { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px;
                padding:18px 20px; margin-bottom:16px; }
    #gl .card-h { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-bottom:14px; }
    #gl .card-t { font-size:15px; font-weight:700; }
    #gl .card-s { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); }

    /* ===== 顶部保存栏 ===== */
    #gl .applybar { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:14px;
                    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px;
                    padding:12px 20px; margin-bottom:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    #gl .applybar .ab-l { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; }
    #gl .note { font-size:13px; color:var(--warn); display:none; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
    #gl .note i { width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--warn); display:inline-block; }
    #gl .btnApply { border:0; background:#cfd4e6 !important; color:#fff; border-radius:999px;
                    padding:10px 34px; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; cursor:not-allowed;
                    transition:all .15s; }
    #gl .btnApply.on { background:var(--apply) !important; cursor:pointer;
                       box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(106,123,250,.4); }
    #gl .btnApply.on:hover { background:#5a6bf0 !important; }
    #gl .btnRevert { border:0; background:transparent !important; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px;
                     font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; padding:6px 4px; }
    #gl .btnRevert:hover { color:var(--text); }

    /* ===== 开关演示（纯展示） ===== */
    #gl .demo { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:28px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    #gl .swg { display:flex; width:272px; height:112px; border-radius:22px; background:#e9ebf0;
               padding:10px; gap:10px; user-select:none; flex:none; }
    #gl .swgHalf { width:0; flex:1 1 0; height:92px; border:1px solid transparent; border-radius:14px;
                   background:#fff; color:#9aa3b2; font-size:15px; font-weight:700;
                   display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
                   gap:6px; position:relative; }
    #gl .swgHalf .ic { font-size:22px; line-height:1; }
    #gl .swgHalf .lb { line-height:1; }
    #gl .swgHalf .pos { display:none; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; line-height:1;
                        padding:3px 9px; border-radius:999px; background:#fff; color:var(--accent); }
    #gl .swg.left  .swgHalf.left,
    #gl .swg.right .swgHalf.right { background:var(--accent); color:#fff; border-color:var(--accent);
                                    box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(91,110,250,.38); }
    #gl .swg.left  .swgHalf.left  .pos,
    #gl .swg.right .swgHalf.right .pos { display:inline-block; }

    #gl .demoInfo { flex:1; min-width:260px; }
    #gl .demoPos { font-size:15px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px; }
    #gl .demoPos .tag { display:inline-block; padding:2px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-size:12px;
                        font-weight:700; margin-left:6px; background:#eaf0ff; color:var(--accent); }
    #gl .acts { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:7px; margin-bottom:11px; }
    #gl .actrow { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:13.5px; }
    #gl .akey { font-size:11.5px; font-weight:700; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:6px; flex:none; }
    #gl .akeyL { background:#eaf0ff; color:var(--accent); }
    #gl .akeyR { background:#eef0f4; color:#6b7688; }
    #gl .aval { font-weight:700; }
    #gl .aval.none { color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; }
    #gl .strow { display:flex; gap:18px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:10px; }
    #gl .st { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); }
    #gl .stv { font-weight:700; margin-left:4px; }
    #gl .stv.on { color:var(--ok); }
    #gl .stv.off { color:var(--muted); }
    #gl .hint { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); }

    /* ===== 功能：左右两栏 ===== */
    #gl .fxrow { display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    #gl .fxcol { flex:1 1 320px; min-width:290px;
                 background:#fafbfc; border:1px solid #f0f2f5; border-radius:12px; padding:4px 16px 14px; }
    #gl .fxcap { font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:.4px;
                 padding:12px 0 8px; }
    #gl .fxlist { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; }
    #gl .fxh { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px; }
    #gl .fxctrls { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    #gl .autoval { font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; color:#6b7688; background:#f4f5f8;
                   border:1px dashed #dfe3ea; border-radius:9px; padding:7px 13px; }

    /* 能力卡片 */
    #gl .cap { border:1px solid #e8ebf2; border-left:3px solid #d7dce8; background:#fff;
               border-radius:10px; padding:11px 13px; margin-bottom:10px; }
    #gl .cap:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }
    #gl .cap.ok   { border-left-color:var(--ok); }
    #gl .cap.bad  { border-left-color:#d7dce8; opacity:.75; }
    #gl .cap.warn { border-left-color:var(--warn); }
    #gl .cap-h { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:5px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    #gl .cap-n { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; }
    #gl .pill { font-size:11px; font-weight:700; padding:2px 9px; border-radius:999px; }
    #gl .pill.running { background:#e8f6ee; color:var(--ok); }
    #gl .pill.idle    { background:#eef0f4; color:#6b7688; }
    #gl .pill.err     { background:#fdecec; color:#d94a4a; }
    #gl .pill.conf    { background:#fff4e2; color:#c47b12; }
    #gl .cap-d { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6; }
    #gl .cap-empty { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); padding:16px 4px; }

    /* 下拉 / 文本 / 分段 */
    #gl .sel { position:relative; display:inline-block; min-width:176px; }
    #gl .selbtn { width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px;
                  background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line) !important; border-radius:10px;
                  padding:10px 14px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text); cursor:pointer; }
    #gl .selbtn .caret { width:9px; height:9px; border-right:2px solid #9aa3b2; border-bottom:2px solid #9aa3b2;
                         transform:rotate(45deg); transition:transform .2s; margin-top:-3px; flex:none; }
    #gl .sel.open .selbtn .caret { transform:rotate(-135deg); margin-top:3px; }
    #gl .menu { position:absolute; top:calc(100% + 6px); left:0; right:0; background:#fff;
                border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(20,30,60,.14);
                padding:6px; z-index:50; display:none; }
    #gl .sel.open .menu { display:block; }
    #gl .opt { padding:9px 12px; border-radius:7px; font-size:14px; cursor:pointer; color:var(--text); }
    #gl .opt:hover { background:#f4f5f8; }
    #gl .opt.cur { color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; }

    #gl .txt { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line) !important; border-radius:10px;
               padding:9px 12px; font-family:inherit; font-size:14px; font-weight:600;
               color:var(--text); width:230px; }
    #gl .txt:focus { border-color:var(--accent) !important; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(91,110,250,.16); }

    #gl .seg { display:inline-flex; background:#eef0f4; border-radius:10px; padding:3px; gap:2px; }
    #gl .seg button { border:0; background:transparent; min-width:78px; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:8px;
                      font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:#8a94a6; cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s; }
    #gl .seg button.active { background:#fff; color:var(--text); box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(16,24,40,.12); }
    #gl .seg.seg4 button { min-width:62px; padding:8px 10px; }

    /* 多选灯 */
    #gl .ledpicks { display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:9px; }
    #gl .ledpick { font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; padding:6px 13px; border-radius:999px;
                   background:#eef0f4; color:#6b7688; cursor:pointer; border:1px solid transparent; }
    #gl .ledpick.on { background:#eaf0ff; color:var(--accent); border-color:#d3dcff; }

    #gl .toast { position:fixed; left:50%; bottom:34px; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
                 background:rgba(38,49,62,.94); color:#fff; padding:11px 22px; border-radius:999px;
                 font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:all .25s; z-index:200; }
    #gl .toast.show { opacity:1; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
</style>

<div id="gl"
     data-url='{{ dispatcher.build_url("admin", "system", "toggle", "data") }}'
     data-save-url='{{ dispatcher.build_url("admin", "system", "toggle", "save") }}'>
<div class="wrap">

    <div class="pghead">
        <div class="pgtitle">拨动开关设置</div>
        <div class="pgsub">配置物理拨动开关的功能与对应动作</div>
    </div>

    <!-- 保存栏（置顶） -->
    <div class="applybar">
        <div class="ab-l">
            <span class="note" id="dirtyNote"><i></i>有未保存的修改</span>
            <button type="button" class="btnRevert" onclick="doRevert()">放弃修改</button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btnApply" id="btnApply" onclick="doSave()" disabled>保存</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 开关演示（纯状态展示，不可点击、无模拟） -->
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-h">
            <div class="card-t">开关演示</div>
            <div class="card-s">实时反映物理开关位置</div>
        </div>
        <div class="demo">
            <div class="swg left" id="swg">
                <div class="swgHalf left">
                    <span class="ic">&#8592;</span><span class="lb">左拨</span><span class="pos">当前</span>
                </div>
                <div class="swgHalf right">
                    <span class="ic">&#8594;</span><span class="lb">右拨</span><span class="pos">当前</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="demoInfo">
                <div class="demoPos">当前位置：<span class="tag" id="demoPos">左侧</span></div>
                <div class="acts">
                    <div class="actrow"><span class="akey akeyL">左拨</span><span class="aval" id="actLeft">无动作</span></div>
                    <div class="actrow"><span class="akey akeyR">右拨</span><span class="aval" id="actRight">无动作</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="strow">
                    <span class="st">蓝灯<b class="stv on" id="blueSt">亮</b></span>
                    <span class="st">白灯<b class="stv off" id="whiteSt">灭</b></span>
                </div>
                <div class="hint">位置与灯态每 3 秒自动刷新。左拨 = 物理 HIGH；右拨 = 物理 LOW。</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 拨动开关功能：左栏功能选项 / 右栏可控制 -->
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-h">
            <div class="card-t">拨动开关功能</div>
            <div class="card-s">右拨动作自动取反，无需单独设置</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fxrow">

            <!-- 左栏 -->
            <div class="fxcol">
                <div class="fxcap">功能选项</div>
                <div class="fxlist">
                    <div id="funcItem">
                        <div class="fxh">功能</div>
                        <div class="fxctrls">
                            <div class="sel" id="funcSel">
                                <button type="button" class="selbtn" onclick="toggleSel('funcSel')">
                                    <span id="funcLabel">无功能</span><span class="caret"></span>
                                </button>
                                <div class="menu" id="funcMenu">
                                    <div class="opt" data-v="none"  onclick="pickFunc('none')">无功能</div>
                                    <div class="opt" data-v="proxy" onclick="pickFunc('proxy')">代理</div>
                                    <div class="opt" data-v="wifi"  onclick="pickFunc('wifi')">Wi-Fi</div>
                                    <div class="opt" data-v="led"   onclick="pickFunc('led')">LED</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="proxyItem">
                        <div class="fxh">代理程序</div>
                        <div class="fxctrls">
                            <div class="sel" id="proxySel">
                                <button type="button" class="selbtn" onclick="toggleSel('proxySel')">
                                    <span id="proxyLabel">自动</span><span class="caret"></span>
                                </button>
                                <div class="menu" id="proxyMenu"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="ledNameItem">
                        <div class="fxh">控制的灯</div>
                        <div class="fxctrls">
                            <input type="text" class="txt" id="ledName" onchange="onText('led_name', this.value)">
                        </div>
                        <div class="ledpicks" id="ledPicks"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="actItem">
                        <div class="fxh">左拨动作</div>
                        <div class="fxctrls"><div class="seg" id="actSeg"></div></div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="rightItem">
                        <div class="fxh">右拨动作</div>
                        <div class="fxctrls"><span class="autoval" id="rightAuto">—</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 右栏 -->
            <div class="fxcol">
                <div class="fxcap">可控制</div>
                <div id="capBox"></div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RESET 重置键 -->
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-h">
            <div class="card-t">RESET 重置键</div>
            <div class="card-s">多击手势，独立于滑块</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f3f6">
            <div><div class="fl" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600">单击</div><div class="fs" style="font-size:12px;color:#8a94a6;margin-top:2px">1 秒内按 1 次</div></div>
            <div class="seg seg4" id="resetSingleSeg">
                <button type="button" data-v="disabled" onclick="pickReset('single','disabled',this)">禁用</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="led"      onclick="pickReset('single','led',this)">蓝灯</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="wifi"     onclick="pickReset('single','wifi',this)">无线</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="reboot"   onclick="pickReset('single','reboot',this)">重启</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f3f6">
            <div><div class="fl" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600">双击</div><div class="fs" style="font-size:12px;color:#8a94a6;margin-top:2px">1 秒内按 2 次</div></div>
            <div class="seg seg4" id="resetDoubleSeg">
                <button type="button" data-v="disabled" onclick="pickReset('double','disabled',this)">禁用</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="led"      onclick="pickReset('double','led',this)">蓝灯</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="wifi"     onclick="pickReset('double','wifi',this)">无线</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="reboot"   onclick="pickReset('double','reboot',this)">重启</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:12px 0">
            <div><div class="fl" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600">三击</div><div class="fs" style="font-size:12px;color:#8a94a6;margin-top:2px">1 秒内按 3 次</div></div>
            <div class="seg seg4" id="resetTripleSeg">
                <button type="button" data-v="disabled" onclick="pickReset('triple','disabled',this)">禁用</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="led"      onclick="pickReset('triple','led',this)">蓝灯</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="wifi"     onclick="pickReset('triple','wifi',this)">无线</button>
                <button type="button" data-v="reboot"   onclick="pickReset('triple','reboot',this)">重启</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hint" style="padding-top:6px">多击需在 1 秒内完成。「蓝灯」切换蓝灯亮灭、「无线」开关 WiFi、「重启」重启设备；选「禁用」则该手势不执行任何动作。长按 5 秒以上仍为恢复出厂设置。</div>
    </div>

</div>
<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>
</div>

{% include('footer') %}

<script src="/luci-static/resources/mt3600be-toggle/toggle.js?v=20260929b"></script>
